<title>INDIA: India's TVS Suzuki 96/97 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>India's TVS Suzuki 96/97 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     281.4  vs    158.2</p>
<p>    Net sales	    3,922.0  vs  2,698.8</p>
<p>    Gross Profit	   505.0  vs    303.6</p>
<p>    Other income	    31.3  vs     20.4</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  3,418.6  vs  2,396.2</p>
<p>    Interest costs	  29.7  vs     19.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    71.3  vs     40.4</p>
<p>    Tax			152.3  vs    105.0</p>
<p>Note: TVS Suzuki Ltd said the results were unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
